{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Verve\u2122",
    "steam_appid": 2514110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/2cf3317a66bbece1e7dfcc0f4a681fbb.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>Welcome to the Verve, where hallways don't end, doors always lead somewhere, and danger is <i>imminent</i>. You are <strong>RT-6</strong>, a member of LiminalLeap's highly-trained professional rescuing team. You are tasked to find the location of a small group of research scientists who sent out a high-level distress call, followed by <u>complete</u> radio silence. Good luck, the void of the Verve is unforgiving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/fa53ccb9bd4cea102a149e9beb9009c2.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>In this psychological horror game, play the singleplayer campaign where you explore the Verve, evade, and hide from entities, and rescue the research scientists deep within the Verve. After being sent into the Verve dimension, you start to realize and uncover the dark truth about LiminalLeap's practices, this isn't going to be a walk in the park.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/bd2d903942d94bbc342c4b05f76d8c25.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>You can also play multiplayer with your friends and run around at unreasonably fast speeds, evade unforgiving nextbots, attempt to survive in the Verve together, go surfing (<strong>NOT ON WATER</strong>), and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/6d2525f994738e8d294070b3f98f3894.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>Verve has an extremely sophisticated movement engine allowing <strong>bunnyhopping</strong>, <strong>airstrafing</strong>, <strong>surfing</strong> on ramps, etc. You can execute some of the most complicated tricks and techniques to go lightning-fast and outrun all of your assailants!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/2cf3317a66bbece1e7dfcc0f4a681fbb.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>Welcome to the Verve, where hallways don't end, doors always lead somewhere, and danger is <i>imminent</i>. You are <strong>RT-6</strong>, a member of LiminalLeap's highly-trained professional rescuing team. You are tasked to find the location of a small group of research scientists who sent out a high-level distress call, followed by <u>complete</u> radio silence. Good luck, the void of the Verve is unforgiving.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/fa53ccb9bd4cea102a149e9beb9009c2.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>In this psychological horror game, play the singleplayer campaign where you explore the Verve, evade, and hide from entities, and rescue the research scientists deep within the Verve. After being sent into the Verve dimension, you start to realize and uncover the dark truth about LiminalLeap's practices, this isn't going to be a walk in the park.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/bd2d903942d94bbc342c4b05f76d8c25.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>You can also play multiplayer with your friends and run around at unreasonably fast speeds, evade unforgiving nextbots, attempt to survive in the Verve together, go surfing (<strong>NOT ON WATER</strong>), and more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514110/extras/6d2525f994738e8d294070b3f98f3894.webp?t=1749045938\" /></span><br>Verve has an extremely sophisticated movement engine allowing <strong>bunnyhopping</strong>, <strong>airstrafing</strong>, <strong>surfing</strong> on ramps, etc. You can execute some of the most complicated tricks and techniques to go lightning-fast and outrun all of your assailants!",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Verve. You are RT-6, a member of LiminalLeap's highly-trained professional rescuing team. You are tasked to find the location of a small group of research scientists who sent out a high-level distress call from deep within the void of Verve. Good luck, the Verve is unforgiving.",
